flowchart TD
    Start[Unknown mobile dials masked number] --> A[Call lands at IVR]
    A --> B{Table 1 lookup}
    B -->|Miss| C[Identification chain runs]
    C --> D[All three lookups miss caller is Unknown]
    D --> E[IVR plays Ask for PIN audio]
    E --> Input{Caller input}
    Input -->|Enters a PIN| G{PIN valid and maps to active ticket}
    Input -->|No PIN entered timeout| NoPin[Play No PIN entered audio]
    NoPin --> NoCount{Prompt count}
    NoCount -->|First or second timeout| E
    NoCount -->|Third timeout| EndNoPin[End call no PIN entered three times]
    G -->|YES| H[API 3 returns counterparty mobile]
    H --> I[Bridge to counterparty]
    I --> Done[Call connects]
    G -->|Wrong PIN| J[Play Wrong PIN audio]
    J --> Retry[IVR plays Ask for PIN audio one more time]
    Retry --> G2{Caller enters PIN}
    G2 -->|Correct PIN| H
    G2 -->|Wrong PIN second time| L[Play Limit reached and end call]

    classDef good fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d
    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    classDef neutral fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f
    class I,Done good
    class L,EndNoPin bad
    class D neutral
